{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Subterranean Anomaly Horror Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped deep beneath the earth in an  underground complex, you awaken to the echoing <i>beep</i> of a countdown. <strong>Explosives have been armed</strong>. The lights flicker. The walls breathe. You don\u2019t know how you got here\u2014but you do know one thing: when the music stops, so do you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a looping, ever-changing labyrinth where nothing stays the same for long. Shadows twist wrong. Objects duplicate. Faces lie. You're being watched, but you\u2019re not sure by what\u2014or <i>how many</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/2595193d4b75d55f9a4b1b029b38c092.poster.avif?t=1761235143\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/2595193d4b75d55f9a4b1b029b38c092.webm?t=1761235143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/2595193d4b75d55f9a4b1b029b38c092.mp4?t=1761235143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corridor may conceal an anomaly: some subtle, some grotesque. Identify them. Memorize patterns. Trust your instincts, not your eyes. The music is your timer, and once it ends... so does your chance to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you spot what shouldn't be there before it's too late?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/72c9f9effb657cc6748453df99451a7e.poster.avif?t=1761235143\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/72c9f9effb657cc6748453df99451a7e.webm?t=1761235143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/extras/72c9f9effb657cc6748453df99451a7e.mp4?t=1761235143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> About the game<br>Play time<br>15 -60 mins<br>Over 18 Anomalies<br>Multiple endings</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387100/e1475317eaf0fab22cbc849a538b2a7f1b302432.jpg"},{"name":"A fine addition to the collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387100/9fd0d73248ad51f9e05c9cddf24220ddef9a849b.jpg"},{"name":"Beacon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387100/120494654da37e9a20c7478e81ea259b02b6083c.jpg"},{"name":"Light at the end","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387100/dbe99e2cb1b2465c6e0f5c230fbcc1441c16f14e.jpg"},{"name":"Bad fate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387100/81d0e79409d97200b9619af16c90a49c6a780d73.jpg"},{"name":"Just in time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387100/82b6022e175e509eb04251f8c968bfdd29d9b62c.jpg"},{"name":"Inventory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3387100/120494654da37e9a20c7478e81ea259b02b6083c.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3387100?t=1761235143","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3387100?t=1761235143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/937deea4dff802dde3e6d1027ca1717907a788a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761235143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387100/937deea4dff802dde3e6d1027ca1717